<title>GERMANY: EMI monthly council meeting starts in Frankfurt.</title>
<headline>EMI monthly council meeting starts in Frankfurt.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Monetary Institute said on Tuesday that the monthly meeting of the EMI council, composed of central bank governors from the EU member-states, began at 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>The EMI said it was not known for how long the meeting would run. It does not comment on the agenda for the meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
